==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Frogadier|23}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Water Drip''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Wingull|95}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Frogadier}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

